# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Aliens Versus Predator: Extinction (56550022), classifier-path benchmark
# (#433): drive generic replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself
# once play is confirmed. AvP:E puts the player in direct third-person
# control of one creature at a time (no base-building cursor), so the loop
# below walks it forward, turns, and attacks -- never START.
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    wait 2.0
    axis LX min
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    mash A 3 0.3
    wait 1.5
}
